   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the tax law, in relation to extending the expiration of the mortgage recording tax imposed by the city of Yonkers",
    "basePrintNo": "S3878",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S3878-2015",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §253-d, Tax L",
    "lawSection": "Tax Law",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S3878\n\nTITLE OF BILL:  An act to amend the tax law, in relation to extending\nthe expiration of the mortgage recording tax imposed by the city of\nYonkers\n\nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nTo extend the expiration of the mortgage recording tax imposed by the\nCity of Yonkers.\n\nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 of the bill amends Subdivision 1 of Section 253-d of the tax\nlaw as amended by Chapter 76 of the Laws of 2013 to extend the\nexpiration of the mortgage recording tax imposed by the City of\nYonkers to August 31, 2017.\n\nSection 2 is the immediate effective date.\n\nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nIn order for the City of Yonkers to adopt its budget, the Mortgage\nRecording Tax must be extended since these revenues are included in\nthe City of Yonkers' budget.\n\nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n2013 - S.4116 - Chapter 76 of 2013\n2011 - S.2983 - Chapter 392 of 2011\n2009 -.S.3334 - Chapter 142 of 2009\n2007 - S.4138 - Chapter 383 of 2007.\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone to the State.\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:\n\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n\n",
